    "caption": "🥳 The final networking event for the ALCHEMIST X & SILICON VALLEY RESIDENCY acceleration program batch!\n\nStartups that completed the program presented their progress pitching to the ALCHEMIST X community and partners.\n\nThis 5-month journey was designed to help high-potential startups from Central Asia and surrounding regions break into the US market. Startups like Pointai, Relog.ai, Most Finance, Parqour, Flowsell.me, Axellero, call2action.kz, cybernet.ai, SmartGas, JobEscape, LoadConnect, and Speechsense are now ready to take on their next big challenge!\n\nCongratulations to all the startups on completing the program! 🎉\n\nThe ALCHEMISTX & SILICON VALLEY RESIDENCY program was launched by The Silkroad Innovation Hub in partnership with Astana Hub, supported by ICRIAP, the World Bank, and the FPIP project!\n\nThank you @alchemistxii for partnership, especially for Christy Canida and Shira Abel for mentorship!\n\nStay tuned to our social media for updates and announcements about their journey! 😉",
